2026-07-27T07:53:43.6955530Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T07:53:43.7014457Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T07:53:43.7015226Z i /tmp/RtmpNPRfbt/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:53:43.7015769Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:53:43.7016649Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:53:43.7017436Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:53:43.7018334Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:53:43.7019847Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:53:43.7020843Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T07:53:43.7240884Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:53:43.7347064Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:53:43.7750476Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:53:43.7896746Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
